msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Good morning, Kiryu-san! We've decided on a cosplay event\r\n"
"today. Pretty neat, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Now, the customers' tastes might be a little different than\r\n"
"usual, so please bear that in mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Good morning, Kiryu-san! %s-san is working today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I'm sure she's been under a lot of pressure lately, so let's\r\n"
"do our best to ease her through the shift as best we can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"First, you should take a walk around the floor. Get a feel\r\n"
"for the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "I haven't seen %s-san at all today... Looks like it's a no-show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Hope this is the last time she pulls this kind of stunt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Good morning, Kiryu-san! Ready to get started?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"First, take a walk around the floor, and then we can get\r\n"
"down to business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Done with your inspection, Kiryu-san? Then let's talk strategy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Tell me more about basic procedure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"The way our club works is fairly straightforward. You go out\r\n"
"on the floor, pick up on the customer vibe, and use that\r\n"
"information to spruce up the lady of the evening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Do that three times, and that's considered a service round.\r\n"
"Then you'll get your results, and then it's onto the next one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Now remember, our revenue depends entirely on how our guests\r\n"
"perceive their time here. So we need to work in concert with\r\n"
"our staff to satisfy their every need and want. Make sense?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Tell me more about inspection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Basically, you'll be walking the premises and getting a feel\r\n"
"for the clientele. It should be easy for you to tell what\r\n"
"type of hostess they're in the mood for just by listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Some customers go solely for appearance; others prefer a\r\n"
"certain area of proficiency... a \"service stat,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"The takeaway here is that our customers won't always want\r\n"
"the same thing. That's what makes inspection so critical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Moreover, our customers might have multiple preferences, so\r\n"
"it's important to decide which preference to prioritize, as\r\n"
"well as take other, more subtle factors into consideration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Tell me more about coordination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"So, you can have the girls coordinate their clothes, makeup,\r\n"
"accessories, and other things to give off a particular vibe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Of course, items and makeup that have already been provided\r\n"
"by the club are free to use. Anything else, we'll need to\r\n"
"pay for up front. I'm sure that goes without saying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"...And, again⑬this should be obvious⑬any expenses we incur\r\n"
"will be deducted from our total club revenue. Rightfully so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Now, clothes and accessories can be swapped out over and\r\n"
"over again, but please be aware you'll have to pay each time\r\n"
"a hostess gets her hair or her nails done. Beauty's not cheap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"However, mixing and matching certain clothes and cosmetics\r\n"
"can lead to surprising results. I guess you'd call them\r\n"
"bonus effects? Anyway, try as many combinations as you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Tell more more about training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Training is what you need to guide these girls to greatness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"Basically, training adjusts a hostess's service stats:\r\n"
"Looks, Smarts, Charisma, Motivation, and Stress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Customers may demand different things out of a hostess\r\n"
"depending on their preferences, so be sure to train them\r\n"
"frequently. That way they can handle the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Also note that repeating the same training may not be very\r\n"
"effective... They get bored rather easily. Understandable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Hostesses are only human beings, you know. They get stressed\r\n"
"just like the rest of us. And trust me, you don't want that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "I'm fine for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"All right, well, just ask me any time you have any questions\r\n"
"and I'll be happy to give you an answer. Mmkay?"
msgstr ""

